cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the data descriptor below."
title: "PERCIVAL: analysis code for the tomato leaf transcriptome and rhizosphere metabarcoding datasets"
abstract: >-
  Scripts and commands for the bioinformatic analyses and figure generation of
  the Scientific Data descriptor "Multi-omics analyses of tomato rhizosphere
  and leaves treated with a biowaste-derived biostimulant extract". RNA-seq:
  preprocessing and alignment, technical validation QC, and quantification of
  the relative contributions of experimental trial, time point and treatment to
  transcriptome variance. Metabarcoding: the MICCA pipeline for the 16S and ITS
  rhizosphere libraries and its technical validation plots.
type: software
license: MIT
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - biostimulant
  - humic substances
  - Solanum lycopersicum
  - batch effect
  - metabarcoding
  - rhizosphere
repository-code: "https://github.com/sonegop/PERCIVAL"
